356:+@test "RAB-22 per-kind caps in the plan and the manifest (DEC-0567): the suite's run_usd_by_type lands in MANIFEST caps; --run-cap 9 overrides both kinds; a suite without run_usd_by_type falls back to run_usd per kind; a malformed entry is a usage error" {
395:+@test "RAB-23 dispatch passes the trial kind's cap to pipeline-run.sh --max-run-usd (build 15, review-catch 20); --run-cap 9 passes 9 to both" {
409:+@test "RAB-24 assumed charges per kind (DEC-0567): a review-catch cap_failure is charged 20 and a costless failed build trial 15; a completed build trial its cost" {
422:+@test "RAB-25 in-flight reservation = running trials x the largest cap among the plan's kinds (DEC-0567): a build trial running in a plan with review-catch reserves 20 (max 27.99 waits, 28 launches); a build-only plan reserves 15 (21.99 waits, 22 launches)" {
448:+@test "RAB-26 --resume keeps the batch's recorded caps: the suite file's caps edited after the start (and a --run-cap on the resume) change neither the dispatch caps nor MANIFEST caps" {
484:+@test "RAB-28 KF-048 pre-flight: an expired codex access token with a1_full planned refuses a fresh batch (exit 2, REFUSED.txt names codex and KF-048, no MANIFEST.json)" {
496:+@test "RAB-29 KF-048 pre-flight: a token that expires inside the horizon (now + 60 s; 2 x summed watchdog / concurrency is hours) is refused" {
503:+@test "RAB-30 KF-048 pre-flight: a fresh token (now + 10 days) is accepted; MANIFEST.json records codex_token_exp at second precision and codex_preflight" {
524:+@test "RAB-31 KF-048 pre-flight: an expired token with only a0_bare planned is not refused; checked false, codex_arms []" {
535:+@test "RAB-32 KF-048 pre-flight: no auth.json is not a refusal; one WARN line, codex_token_exp null" {
544:+@test "RAB-33 KF-048 pre-flight: --smoke skips the check (an expired token is not refused)" {
552:+@test "RAB-34 KF-048 pre-flight: --dry-run with an expired token is refused (the dry run is where the operator sees it first); a malformed access token is refused too" {
571:diff --git a/evals/tests/seed-bugfix.bats b/evals/tests/seed-bugfix.bats
574:+++ b/evals/tests/seed-bugfix.bats
585:diff --git a/evals/tests/seed-refactor.bats b/evals/tests/seed-refactor.bats
588:+++ b/evals/tests/seed-refactor.bats
599:diff --git a/evals/tests/validate-suite.bats b/evals/tests/validate-suite.bats
602:+++ b/evals/tests/validate-suite.bats

